    {
      "id": "rule-b1bf3983",
      "tag": "rule",
      "text": "A message is trashed only because a rule the user wrote matched it, and never because the model judged it junk — the model may propose a rule, but it may never act as one, so every trashed thread can be named by the rule that took it.",
